  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_2726.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) La pe&ntilde;a cultural taurina Chicuelina de Onda ha organizado este s&aacute;bado en su local social de la calle Pintor Oliet la conferencia anual para analizar la feria de la Magdalena, esta vez a cargo de Ram&oacute;n Quesada, presidente de la Federaci&oacute;n de Pe&ntilde;as Taurinas de Castell&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/04/Agenda-Concert-Pasdobles-2017-Peña-Chicuelina.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 664px;\" /></p>\n<p>El pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado, 8 de abril, se celebrar&aacute; el tradicional concierto de pasodobles taurinos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2708.jpg\" alt=\"img_2708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2714.jpg\" alt=\"img_2714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2716.jpg\" alt=\"img_2716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2717.jpg\" alt=\"img_2717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2718.jpg\" alt=\"img_2718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalenachicuelina17/img_2720.jpg\" alt=\"img_2720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciafiramagdalena